  "body": "### What is the issue with the Compatibility Standard?\n\nThere is an intent to ship a new Chrome UA on iOS including a bugfix number. This will probably modify the UA string description which is currently available in the compat spec. \r\n\r\nDetails in https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/I5r9cxliL-0/m/o46YrSmqAAAJ?pli=1",
